      "details": "\r\n<p>Soluntum is listed as \"Solunto\" in the <em>BTCGI</em>. \"Solunto\" is also the current Italian name of the archaeological area. Manni 1981 refers to the nearby promontory of \"S\u00f2lanto\", in the municipality of Santa Flavia.</p>\r\n",
